                     <note>The text is incomplete.</note>
                     <incipit xml:lang="bo">rje btsun bla ma dam pa thub dbang rdo rje 'chang dang dbyer ma mchis pa'i zhabs la dus thams cad du phyag 'tshal lo/ /brtse ba chen pos rjes su gzung du gsol/ /'dir skal ldan gyi skyes bu sangs rgyas kyi sar bgrod par byed pa'i thabs zab mo byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i 'khrid la gnyis/</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="bo">de ltar lam thun mong bas rgyud sbyangs nas nges par rdo rje theg pa la 'jug dgos te/ lam de la brten na bskal pa grangs med gsum la mi ltos par tshogs gnyis bde blag du rdzogs par 'gyur bas so// de yang bshes gnyen bsten tshul nas zhi gnas dang lhag mthong ... /</explicit>
